oreactivity, and regulates fascial gliding and viscoelasticity.\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_9900001 \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3497\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_9900001 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5507-2103>)\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:CL_9900001 \"GitHub Copilot\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_9900001 \"2026-05-17T01:04:21Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:29575206\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_9900001 \"fasciocyte\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_9900001 \"fasciacyte\")\n+SubClassOf(obo:CL_9900001 obo:CL_0000499)\n+\n # Class: obo:CL_7770003 (beam A cell)\n \n AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:36646180\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_7770003 \"A tissue-resident macrophage found in the mesothelium of the zebrafish heart. This cell is transcriptionally characterized by high expression of lgals3bpb, slc40a1, ccl35.2, itgb3a, and tifab. It is one of several macrophage populations that contribute to epicardial and valvular homeostasis, and likely participates in extracellular matrix remodeling and immune surveillance.\")\n*** End Patch"},"error":"apply_patch verification failed: Error: Failed to find expected lines in /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/src/ontology/cl-edit.owl:\n# Class: obo:CL_4072104 (fibrochondrocyte)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:29563130\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4072104 \"A chondrocyte-like cell found in dense connective tissue, such as tendon, ligament, and meniscus, that displays features intermediate between fibroblasts and chondrocytes. This cell expresses cartilage-related extracellular matrix components, including type II collagen and aggrecan, while also contributing to the fibrous matrix and mechanoadaptation of fibrocartilaginous tissues.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4072104 <https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277>)\n